#. i18n: file: krusader/ActionMan/actionproperty.ui:130
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, leDistinctName)
#: rc.cpp:44
msgid ""
"Unique name of the <b>Useraction</b>. It is only used in the "
"<i>Konfigurator</i> and doesn't appear in any other menu.<p><b>Note</b>: The "
"<i>Title</i> shown in the <b>Usermenu</b> can be set below."
msgstr ""
"Eenkennig Naam vun de <b>Brukerakschoon</b>. He warrt bloost binnen den "
"<i>Instellendialoog</i> bruukt un dukt narms sünst op.<p><b>Beacht bitte:</"
"b> Den <i>Titel</i>, de binnen dat <b>Brukermenü</b> wiest warrt, kannst Du "
"nerrn fastleggen."

#. i18n: file: krusader/ActionMan/actionproperty.ui:137
