#: rc.cpp:47 rc.cpp:85
msgid ""
"<b>Useractions</b> can be grouped in categories for better distinction. "
"Choose a existing <i>Category</i> or create a new one by entering a name."
msgstr ""
"<b>Brukerakschonen</b> laat sik Kategorien towiesen, dormit allens sien "
"Schick hett. Söök en vörhannen Kategorie ut oder giff en Naam in un stell so "
"en nieg op."

#. i18n: file: krusader/ActionMan/actionproperty.ui:167
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIconButton, ButtonIcon)
#: rc.cpp:50
msgid ""
"Each <b>Useraction</b> can have its own icon. It will appear in front of the "
"title in the <b>Usermenu</b>."
msgstr ""
"Elkeen <b>Brukerakschoon</b> kann ehr egen Lüttbild hebben. Dat dukt vöran "
"den Titel binnen dat <b>Brukermenü</b> op."

#. i18n: file: krusader/ActionMan/actionproperty.ui:182
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, LabelDistinctName)
#: rc.cpp:53
msgid ""
"<p>Unique name of the <b>Useraction</b>. It is only used in the "
"<i>Konfigurator</i> and doesn't appear in any other menu.</p><p><b>Note</b>: "
"The <i>Title</i> shown in the <b>Usermenu</b> can be set below.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Eenkennig Naam vun de <b>Brukerakschoon</b>. He warrt bloost binnen den "
"<i>Instellendialoog</i> bruukt un dukt narms sünst op.</p><p><b>Beacht bitte:"
"</b> Den <i>Titel</i>, de binnen dat <b>Brukermenü</b> wiest warrt, kannst "
"Du nerrn fastleggen.</p>"

