#: krusader/Dialogs/krmaskchoice.cpp:99
msgid ""
"A predefined selection is a file-mask which you use often.\n"
"Some examples are: \"*.c, *.h\", \"*.c, *.o\", etc.\n"
"You can add these masks to the list by typing them and pressing the Add "
"button.\n"
"Delete removes a predefined selection and Clear removes all of them.\n"
"Notice that the line in which you edit the mask has it's own history, you "
"can scroll it, if needed."
msgstr ""
"En vörinstellt Köör is en Dateimuster, dat Du faken bruukst.\n"
"Bispelen sünd \"*.c, *.h\", \"*.c, *.o\" usw.\n"
"Du kannst disse Mustern de List tofögen, wenn Du dat Muster ingiffst un op "
"\"Tofögen\" klickst.\n"
"\"Wegdoon\" deit een vörinstellt Muster weg, \"Leddig maken\" deit all "
"Mustern weg.\n"
"Beacht bitte, de Reeg, binnen de Du dat Muster bewerken deist, hett ehr egen "
"Vörgeschicht. Du kannst dor binnen rop un daal rullen."

#: krusader/Dialogs/krmaskchoice.cpp:107
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Tofögen"

#: krusader/Dialogs/krmaskchoice.cpp:108
msgid "Adds the selection in the line-edit to the list"
msgstr "De List dat Muster binnen de Bewerkenreeg tofögen"

#: krusader/Dialogs/krmaskchoice.cpp:113
msgid "Delete the marked selection from the list"
msgstr "Dat utsöchte Muster ut de List wegdoon"

#: krusader/Dialogs/krmaskchoice.cpp:117
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Leddig maken"

#: krusader/Dialogs/krmaskchoice.cpp:118
msgid "Clears the entire list of selections"
msgstr "De hele List vun Mustern leddig maken"

#: krusader/Dialogs/krmaskchoice.cpp:133
